    out_type: An optional `tf.DType` from: `tf.qint8, tf.quint8, tf.qint32, tf.qint16, tf.quint16`. Defaults to `tf.qint32`.
    dilations: An optional list of `ints`. Defaults to `[1, 1, 1, 1]`.
